{"t":"Kingdom of Kormarak Quest","s":"kingdom-of-kormarak-quest-a1b55","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Ancient_Temple_4_8b25b9.jpg","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Kingdom of Kormarak Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Old Mintwallin Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(15 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This quest has no legend.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Temple\">Ancient Temple</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\">Rotworms</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc\">Orcs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Spearman\">Orc Spearmen</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Warrior\">Orc Warriors</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">Skeletons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur\">Minotaurs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghouls</a> and a single <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">Demon Skeleton</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Armor\">Brass Armor</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Helmet\">Brass Helmet</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hatchet\">Hatchet</a> and 13 <a href=\"#/wiki/Throwing%20Star\">Throwing Stars</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\nThis quest is a <a href=\"#/wiki/Daily%20Respawns\">daily respawn</a>. This means only one Character can get the rewards per <a href=\"#/wiki/Floor%20Reset\">Floor Reset</a>.<br/>\nIt is recommended to do this quest after <a href=\"#/wiki/Server%20Save\">Server Save</a>, so there is a higher chance nobody have gotten the reward before.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Recommended_equipment\">Recommended equipment</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a> or equivalent, to avoid getting stuck if you go the wrong way</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fireball\">Great Fireball</a> and Heavy Magic Missile Runes for lower level mages</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Health%20Potion\">Health</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potion\">Mana Potions</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 400px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"Ancient Temple-4\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"186\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ancient_Temple_4_8b25b9.jpg\" width=\"400\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> </figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li>Go down to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Temple\">Ancient Temple</a>, near the <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> northern entrace (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32356,32171,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32356, 32171, 7)</a>).</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Go down the ladder to the north.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Follow the white line through the dungeon and climb down the ladder. You will likely encounter <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\">Rotworms</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spiders</a> and weaker <a href=\"#/wiki/Orcs\">Orcs</a>.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>There is a room with lots of <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Gas\">Poison Gas</a> but you only have to go through four of them. Cast the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cure%20Poison\">Antidote</a> spell if you don't want to receive further damage and climb down.</li></ul>\n<figure class=\"thumb show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 200px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"Way to Kingdom of Kormarak\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"181\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Way_to_Kingdom_of_Kormarak_175f7a.jpg\" width=\"200\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> </figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li>Down this ladder there are 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur\">Minotaurs</a> and a few Poison Spiders. Go north following the line. You can also go by a room with <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">Skeletons</a> and do the <a href=\"#/quest/ghoul-room-quest\">Ghoul Room Quest</a> now.</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a sign.<br/>You read: Home of the dead Kingdom of Kormarak<br/>Enter and die!</span></dd></dl>\n<ul><li>Go up the stairs and you may have to kill three <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghouls</a> that spawn there.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Go through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Forcefield\">Magic Forcefield</a>. Be prepared to face 11 Ghouls spread throughout the room and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">Demon Skeleton</a> that spawns at the far end of the room. Use some <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fireball\">Great Fireballs</a> to take the Ghouls out quick and kill the <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">Demon Skeleton</a> by shooting Heavy Magic Missiles while running away.</li></ul>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Kingdom of Kormarak respawn\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"294\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Kingdom_of_Kormarak_respawn_dd0927.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Open the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dead%20Human\">Dead Human</a> near the <a href=\"#/wiki/Wooden%20Coffin\">Wooden Coffin</a> to find a <a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Armor\">Brass Armor</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Helmet\">Brass Helmet</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Hatchet\">Hatchet</a> and 13 <a href=\"#/wiki/Throwing%20Star\">Throwing Stars</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":[]}